      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PITSTONE NICKY (8) has recorded back to back wins, the quickest two back at this track in 25.70. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Can continue the winning form. LUMEAH THUNDER (4) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when third (30.19) at Dubbo. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Likely to be in the finish again. FLASHBACK JIM (7) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 330m behind Classic Edge (19.47) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to give a good account. YATHONG TIGER (3) generally performs well here at this distance.",
